This project includes code adapted from third-party open source projects.
User-facing product surfaces refer only to "BB" and never name these
dependencies directly; attribution is recorded here instead.

## Cua Driver

BB's desktop automation feature (Computer) provisions and supervises the Cua
Driver daemon (https://github.com/trycua/cua) as a BB-managed dependency,
installed into BB's own data directory. Cua Driver is a separate project
under its own license; BB does not redistribute its source.

